                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Despite its weaknesses, an incredible overlooked gem. I attribute most of my Shoot 'Em Up Skills and appreciation for the genre to this game.\n\nSpecial mention of the soundtrack by Blankfield ([url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/280560/discussions/0/540736965882213683/]forum thread[/url]), which is a huge draw to this game and always made me engaged with the action.\n\nI came back to the game years later to finally get the remaining achievements and fully finish it, but that's where the weaknesses became apparent: I consider the playstyle necessary to get the highest scores passive-aggressive and simply unfun. In the end, I had to abandon my question for completion because of the unachievable Trillionaire achievement ([url=https://youtu.be/mkw3Jiyulv8]dedicated gameplay recording of someone achieving it[/url]).\n\nBut despite that, this game will forever be special to me and I wholeheartedly recommend it to everyone, just don't expect to get all the achievements.\n\n[h3]How I beat the True Boss:[/h3]\n[list]\n[*]Difficulty: Burst Hard\n[*]Config: Track 1, A.D.S 4, Lives 4, Continue 2\n[/list]\n\n[h3]Further reading:[/h3]\n[list]\n[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/280560/discussions/0/540736587380256259/#c540737414656962803]Forum comment with scoring tips[/url]\n[*][url=https://shmups.wiki/library/Danmaku_Unlimited_2]Game Overview on Shmups Wiki[/url]\n[/list]",
